sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant P as Portal
  participant A as Auth API
  participant J as JwtService
  participant DB as MySQL
  U->>P: username, password
  P->>A: POST /auth/login
  A->>DB: select user by username
  DB-->>A: user row or none
  Note over A: BCrypt verify (dummy hash<br/>if the user is unknown)
  alt invalid credentials
    A-->>P: 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
    P-->>U: login page with message
  else inactive account
    A-->>P: 403 USER_INACTIVE
  else valid
    A->>DB: update last_login_at
    A->>J: access and refresh tokens
    J-->>A: HS256 tokens (jti, exp)
    A-->>P: access_token, refresh_token
    P->>A: GET /auth/me (Bearer)
    A->>DB: roles, permissions
    DB-->>A: permission keys
    A-->>P: profile, roles, permissions
    Note over P: kept in server-side session
    P-->>U: dashboard, menu filtered<br/>by permissions
  end
